  DialogueBox: {fileID: 0}
  textComponent: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - ...Maguso? ...Is that you?
  - Thank you... old friend... You have freed me...
  - ...Our old leader Skar... He betrayed us... He wanted the power all to himself...
  - He turned us into these <i>things</i>... sealing us and the elements away...
  - ...Made us into monsters... And forced us to gaurd the elements for him...
  - But now... my soul is free and I can finally move on... Thank you...
  - ...And good luck against the others...
  textSpeed: 0.1
